Title: City Manager

c.. CONFERENCE WITH LEGAL COUNSEL (ANTICIPATED LITIGATION) 
(Government Code Section 54956.9 (d)(2) and (e)(1)) 

A point has been reached where, in the opinion of the City Council on the advice of its City Attorney, based on existing facts and circumstances, there is a significant exposure to litigation against the City.

Number of Cases: 3

